# Billing cron jobs (production)

Schedule these on your API host (Railway, Render cron, GCP Cloud Scheduler, etc.):

```cron
# Every 15 minutes — acknowledge subscriptions within Google's 3-day window
*/15 * * * * cd /app/backend && npm run billing:retry-fulfillment

# Daily at 03:00 UTC — reconcile Google subscription state drift
0 3 * * * cd /app/backend && npm run billing:reconcile-subscriptions
```

Required env: `GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON`, `GOOGLE_PLAY_PACKAGE_NAME`, `GOOGLE_PLAY_RTDN_AUDIENCE`, `BILLING_DEV_MODE=false`.

See `GOOGLE_PLAY_CONSOLE_SETUP.txt` for Play Console + Pub/Sub wiring.
